# Core — WaiteM124 profile README

## Repository identity

This repository is Miles Waite's GitHub profile README
(`github.com/WaiteM124/WaiteM124`). The root `README.md` is the profile shown
on `github.com/WaiteM124`. It is not an application codebase.

## Non-negotiables

- Every claim must be factual and must match Miles's CV, LinkedIn, and live
  projects. No invented metrics, dates, outcomes, or status.
- Links must point to real, working repos and sites. No placeholders.
- Do not change `README.md` content unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not commit secrets, tokens, private keys, or non-public personal data.
- Keep changes scoped to the requested task.
- State assumptions in the pull request description.
- Never weaken CI or pre-commit checks to force a pass. Prefer explicit ignores
  plus documented follow-ups when existing content must remain unchanged.

## Workflow for agents

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and this rule before editing.
2. Prefer config and ignore changes over rewriting profile prose.
3. Verify links and factual claims against live sources when making content
   changes; if verification is impossible, say so in the PR.
4. Leave existing workflows (if any) working; add checks without breaking them.
